1
00:04:47,368 --> 00:04:53,368
Never underestimate a nobody.

2
00:09:34,736 --> 00:09:40,736
Nobody is a action, thriller film directed by Ilya Naishuller.

3
00:14:22,105 --> 00:14:28,105
Hutch Mansell, a suburban dad, overlooked husband, nothing neighbor — a "nobody." When two thieves break into his home one night, Hutch's
unknown long-simmering rage is ignited and propels him on a brutal path that will uncover dark secrets he fought to leave behind.

4
00:19:09,473 --> 00:19:15,473
Hutch Mansell, played by Bob Odenkirk.

5
00:23:56,842 --> 00:24:02,842
Yulian Kuznetsov, played by Aleksey Serebryakov.

6
00:28:44,210 --> 00:28:50,210
Becca Mansell, played by Connie Nielsen.

7
00:33:31,578 --> 00:33:37,578
David Mansell, played by Christopher Lloyd.

8
00:38:18,947 --> 00:38:24,947
Eddie Williams, played by Michael Ironside.

9
00:43:06,315 --> 00:43:12,315
The Barber, played by Colin Salmon.

10
00:47:53,684 --> 00:47:59,684
Nobody is a 2021 American action thriller film directed by
Ilya Naishuller and written by Derek Kolstad.

11
00:52:41,052 --> 00:52:47,052
The film stars Bob Odenkirk as a mild-mannered family man who returns to his former life of an
assassin after he and his family become the target of a vengeful crime lord.

12
00:57:28,421 --> 00:57:34,421
Connie Nielsen, RZA, Aleksei Serebryakov, and
Christopher Lloyd appear in supporting roles.

13
01:02:15,789 --> 01:02:21,789
Odenkirk and David Leitch are among the film's producers.

14
01:07:03,157 --> 01:07:09,157
Universal Pictures released Nobody theatrically in
the United States on March 26, 2021.

15
01:11:50,526 --> 01:11:56,526
The film grossed $57 million on a $16 million budget and received generally positive reviews
from critics, who praised the action sequences and Odenkirk's performance.

16
01:16:37,894 --> 01:16:43,894
A sequel, Nobody 2, was released on August 15, 2025.

17
01:21:25,263 --> 01:21:31,263
The film explores themes of assassin, double life, fight,
midlife crisis, bratva (russian mafia).

18
01:26:12,631 --> 01:26:18,631
The tone is dark and intense.
